%% Ingestion run / recon run lifecycle (saga)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED : request accepted (idempotency key)
  QUEUED --> WAITING : same scope already running
  WAITING --> QUEUED : scope released
  QUEUED --> PLANNING : admission granted
  PLANNING --> RUNNING : chunks / buckets published
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : chunk completed · heartbeat
  RUNNING --> FINALIZING : all units complete
  FINALIZING --> COMPLETED : counts balance, no rejects
  FINALIZING --> COMPLETED_WITH_REJECTS : counts balance, rejects present
  FINALIZING --> FAILED : counts do not balance
  RUNNING --> FAILED : unit dead-lettered after max attempts
  RUNNING --> CANCELLED : operator cancel
  FAILED --> QUEUED : replay (new run, supersedes)
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  COMPLETED_WITH_REJECTS --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
